Option Explicit
Say "{{green 12}}Function: MUSIC(Command[String]) -> Nothing"
Say "{{lred}}Restriction: Can only be used locally (local script or CLI)"
Say ""
Say "{{green}}Commands:"
Say "  play <file>    play a sound file once"
Say "  loop <file>    play it over and over"
Say "  stop           stop whatever is playing"
Say "  volume <0-100> set how loud it is"
Say ""
Say "File names work as they do anywhere else, so a relative one is taken"
Say "from the current directory. Put your own files in /home/music."
